<p>Hi <%= @poll.organizer_name %>,</p>

<p>Your poll <strong><%= @poll.name %></strong> is ready.</p>

<p>Share this link with everyone you want to invite:<br>
<%= link_to @public_url, @public_url %></p>

<p>Your private admin link (don't share it; it's the only way to manage the poll):<br>
<%= link_to @admin_url, @admin_url %></p>

<p>Voting closes <%= @poll.end_voting_at.in_time_zone(@poll.zone).strftime("%A, %B %-d at %H:%M") %> (<%= @poll.time_zone %>).</p>
